  "details": "As the title suggests, since the other day, when I look at the social menu, I don't see all my friends.\n\nOnly those who have blocked I will be able to see them.\n\nAlso, people in the same instance can be seen \"In Instance\".\n\nWhen I try to log in at the official site, I get \"Failed to Log In Application error\" is displayed.\n\nThis seems to have something to do with it.\n\nPeople with the same bug are seen around.\n\n(DeepL Translation)",
